00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:54.649
the current situation with the situation in
the 90s and in the 90s, it was it was becoming

00:06:54.649 --> 00:07:00.229
apparent that the dependency that big, fast
growing cities had on the horse and horse

00:07:00.229 --> 00:07:02.460
based transport was completely unsustainable.

00:07:02.460 --> 00:07:06.550
